@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-admin-bearer-token

### Get active categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/masters?type=Category
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get active items for Window
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/masters?type=Item&parentId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get active types for Sliding Window
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/masters?type=Type&parentId=101
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get active topology options for Sliding Window
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/masters?type=Topology&parentId=101
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get active glass options
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/masters?type=Glass
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List all options, including inactive (Admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/masters?includeInactive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one option
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/masters/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing option returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/masters/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an item under Window (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/masters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "masterType": "Item",
  "name": "Fixed Window",
  "parentId": 1
}

### Create an item with type, topology, and common glass tags (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/masters/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "itemName": "Bay Window",
  "types": ["2-Track", "3-Track"],
  "topologies": ["2 Panel", "Corner"],
  "glass": ["Low-E"]
}

### Rename a master option (Admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/masters/101
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sliding Window"
}

### Deactivate a master option (Admin only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/masters/101/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

